      "i": 2,
      "heading": "Meeting Ghost, Jack Sparrow, and other iconic characters from the world of games and movies all in one day? No problem at Comic-Con Prague. Once again, the atmosphere was amazing – full of creative cosplays and passionate fans everywhere you looked. Here’s a short photo report from the event. I didn’t have as much time this year since I was also filming another fair during the same week, but still – a busy yet fantastic start to April, just the way I like it.",
